    <h1>Is Your Hair Loss Actually Genetic? Take 60 Seconds to Find Out</h1>
    <p class="vy-sub">Not all hair loss has the same cause, and the right response depends entirely on which type you have. Before you spend a dollar on the wrong fix, run through this quick self-check.</p>
