    <p class="vy-lede">Here is the uncomfortable truth about hair loss: most men buy a fix before they know the cause. They grab a shampoo, a vitamin, or whatever an ad showed them at 1 a.m., give it two months, see nothing, and conclude that nothing works.</p>
    <p>The problem usually is not the product. It is the diagnosis. Hair loss has at least five distinct causes, and a remedy aimed at the wrong one does nothing at all.</p>
    <p>So before anything else, figure out which type you are dealing with. The quick self-check below takes about a minute, and it is built around the same questions a dermatologist would ask you first.</p>

    <h2 id="self-check">The 60-Second Self-Check</h2>
